<title>INDONESIA: Ramayana says Q1 net up sharply.</title>
<headline>Ramayana says Q1 net up sharply.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31</p>
<p>				  (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net sales		   347.59	   vs    280.37</p>
<p>    Net income		   39.89	   vs     25.00</p>
<p>    Gross profit		 99.41	   vs     82.15</p>
<p>    Operating income	   45.19	   vs     39.53</p>
<p>    Charges			(6.24)	  vs     (6.37)</p>
<p>    Provision for tax	  11.54	   vs	8.16</p>
<p>Note: PT Ramayana Lestari Sentosa is a department store chain which was listed in Jakarta on July 24, 1996. The results were unaudited.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom (6221) 384-6364</p>
</text>
